    "scenesThatPass": [
      "PANDORA: Is it true, Maharet? Has our Queen really risen!\nMAHARET: Don't be so happy, Pandora. I knew Akasha when she walked this earth. I was her slave. I am now her enemy. I know what she is capable of.",
      "PANDORA: Yes. That's right. She and the covens will take care of that brat. We must go to the concert and pay our respects to our great Queen.\nMAHARET: How? With your own throat! You've all been asleep too long! You're still dreaming.",
      "PANDORA: It's just like Nero's day.\nMAHARET: Akasha will not be able to resist this...",
      "MAHARET: Akasha. The world has changed since you reigned.\nAKASHA: Then we shall change it back. Humans are animals, brute creatures. Their destruction can only make sense.\nMAHARET: We've found other ways to co- exist.\nAKASHA: Yes. In the shadows. In silence. In shame. For what? For respect of mortals? They are nothing to us. They are only... food.",
      "AKASHA: You think you can change my will? I'm tired of this discussion. Join me, or die.\nMAHARET: I will not."
    ]
  },
